        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You have touched the seventh sense, and the world's ordinary rules have stopped applying to your fists.</p><p><strong>Passive.</strong> Your Strikes ignore resistances and bypass all material weaknesses and immunities; you strike incorporeal creatures normally. You automatically know the location of anything that has damaged you in the last minute.</p><hr /><p>You gain @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-class-features.Item.Burn Your Cosmo] &#9670; &mdash; a free action, once per day, that treats today as <strong>Exalted</strong> for 1 minute.</p>"
        },
